UID:10076066-1784998800-1784998800@www.saintjameslancaster.org
SUMMARY:Saturday Night Mass
DESCRIPTION:Schools of Hope: A punk-folk fusion fundraiser for the School District of Lancaster\nJoin us for a night of inspiration and community on Saturday\, July 25th at 5:00 PM as we come together to support the School District of Lancaster. We are thrilled to welcome the incredible April Hartman of Apes of the State as our special guest. \nThis event promises to be a vibrant fusion of music and purpose\, uniting us in our commitment to education and hope for a brighter future. Whether you join us in person or tune in virtually\, your presence will make a difference!
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/saturday-night-mass-4/
LOCATION:Saint James Episcopal Church\, 103 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
